! ================================================================================================
! balta_full - modelo de barras de la plataforma PuenteGemelo  exportado a Ansys Mechanical APDL
! Portico plano en Y-Z (Y a lo largo del puente, Z vertical). Unidades: kN, m, t, s (E en kN/m2, masa en t).
! Nodos: 207 de la app + 900 intermedios. Barras: 300 (1200 BEAM188 cubicas). Masas: 207.
! Hipotesis: viga de Euler-Bernoulli (G = 10 000 E), la misma de la app.
! Frecuencias de la app (Hz): 2.7661, 5.1142, 7.2760, 7.3380, 7.5686, 8.1986, 8.4572, 8.8751
! Geometria desde la nube de puntos; secciones, material y cargas segun los datos ingresados en la app (revise su origen en el informe).
! ================================================================================================
FINISH
/CLEAR,NOSTART
/TITLE,balta_full - modelo de la plataforma PuenteGemelo (Euler-Bernoulli)
/PREP7
ET,1,BEAM188
KEYOPT,1,3,3            ! forma cubica
ET,2,MASS21
MP,EX,1,100000000.0          ! arco
MP,PRXY,1,0.3
MP,GXY,1,1.000000000e+12
SECTYPE,1,BEAM,ASEC
SECDATA,0.2940000000,0.02019500000,0,0.02019500000,0,0.04039000000
MP,EX,2,100000000.0          ! tablero
MP,PRXY,2,0.3
MP,GXY,2,1.000000000e+12
SECTYPE,2,BEAM,ASEC
SECDATA,0.3600000000,0.005000000000,0,0.005000000000,0,0.01000000000
MP,EX,3,100000000.0          ! montante
MP,PRXY,3,0.3
MP,GXY,3,1.000000000e+12
SECTYPE,3,BEAM,ASEC
SECDATA,0.05000000000,0.0005000000000,0,0.0005000000000,0,0.001000000000
MP,EX,4,250000000.0          ! pilar
MP,PRXY,4,0.3
MP,GXY,4,2.500000000e+12
SECTYPE,4,BEAM,ASEC
SECDATA,36.45000000,27.33750000,0,27.33750000,0,54.67500000
MP,EX,5,5000000.000          ! pilar
MP,PRXY,5,0.3
MP,GXY,5,5.000000000e+10
